<title>UK: London silver fixes just easier at 434.25 cents.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes just easier at 434.25 cents.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed firmer at 434.25 cents vs 435.90 cents onm Friday. Fairly slow with gold after failing at440 cents late Friday. Interest quite limited.</p>
<p>GOLD - Steady at $321.90/$322.40 vs $319.80/$320.30 close.</p>
<p>Quiet, some physical interest, also hedge selling.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Steady quiet at $406.00/$409.00, down $0.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Up $4.50 at $171.00/$174.00.</p>
</text>
